infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Everything the gateway centralizes, it also concentrates
  desc One consistency win bought with four concentrated costs — all on the critical path of every request
  lists
    - label Single point of failure
      desc Gateway down or misconfigured = all services behind it unreachable, regardless of their own health (the 2 a.m. typo)
    - label Throughput bottleneck
      desc All traffic plus per-request work — token parsing, rate-limit lookups, TLS, aggregation — lands on one tier that must scale ahead of every backend combined
    - label Latency tax
      desc Adds a hop and per-request CPU to every call — usually small, but real, and on the critical path of everything
    - label Deployment chokepoint
      desc If every team's routing config lives in the gateway, the gateway team becomes the bottleneck for shipping — the org version of the SPOF
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
